 know what would happen during his stay there.","detailedDescription":"Terrors to Unveil is a series-based psychological horror game that immerses players in disturbing stories, each one unraveling the terrifying stories of those who lived to tell their experiences.\n\nThis is the second episode in the series:\n\nEpisode 2: Terrors to Unveil - Day Off\n\nYou're Jack Williams, a 26-year-old hard worker who after several days of work managed to get a day off. Without thinking about it, you decide to spend your weekend at your cottage in the woods with your dog as your sole companion. But you didn't know what your stay there would involve.\n\nThe Gameplay\n\nThis game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator with exploration, and conversation mechanics.\n\nKey Features\n\n• \nAtmospheric environment and photo-realistic graphics.\n\n• \n2 Endings\n\n• \nVHS film aesthetic.\n\n• \nInteract with NPCs.\n\n• \nPlayer voice activity.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/ad38d7ab0135468d698238d0d06e0e68ea41d49e/header.jpg?t=1789397063"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/ccdb9490b15918d043ea5af13b93a3fc09fcb53e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1789397063"},{"role":"description","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/extras/852313a8eca246c6e2776137b2dbfc3a.avif?t=1789397063","alt":""}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/7ae08b75fea7325600aa39b25b32467b0fcf82c3/ss_7ae08b75fea7325600aa39b25b32467b0fcf82c3.600x338.jpg?t=1789397063","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587490/7ae08b75fea7325600aa39b25b32467b0fcf82c3/ss_7ae08b75fea7325600a